<p>Ukraine said it has renewed a proposal to Russia for both sides to stop attacking energy infrastructure. President Volodymyr Zelensky said the offer was passed to Moscow through U.S. intermediaries and remains on the table if Russia stops such strikes first. Zelensky also tied any durable settlement to ongoing talks with U.S. negotiators over security guarantees, while presenting the energy truce as a limited but practical way to reduce harm during the war. The latest appeal comes days before Orthodox Easter on April 13 and after another overnight attack on Odesa killed three people and injured at least 16, underscoring how hard even a narrow pause would be to secure. The broader war has now lasted more than four years since Russia’s full-scale invasion, and Zelensky said he doubts Moscow will accept the offer, though Kyiv is still publicly pressing for a reciprocal pause on strikes against critical civilian infrastructure.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/9XMIUAhz-csGSBBsfLE_Rl29cW_EsMADA00zgrA6dcyXxpiPujZker3noRHihuBH7DZ8bVGP_SiZRQGm-H_Y8TfkQx1QC3kVR_s7m_og8Ry9uSofPGtMCSQj5JfvSTW2lxmtjjVFx3c211WpillCD_h36c-a1wgQ3TJNV9ixxogYqrVEIQy86jV9Mw-S8rSlI0VYC8WqkZF9Z1AYZ42VZSFptnCyzq18Vrrb3MXwzOyJR9f_V95hbV5sr-YmYu44oPPkBwFwN1kbWM_ShQ' alt='Image accompanying reporting on Zelenskyy’s renewed truce offer ahead of Orthodox Easter' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Holiday test: Zelensky said Kyiv had repeatedly proposed at least an Easter ceasefire, but argued Moscow was showing no sign that it saw the Orthodox holiday as a reason to pause attacks.</li><li>Oil terminal: Russia’s Defence Ministry said a Ukrainian drone strike damaged a mooring point and set four oil tanks on fire at the Caspian Pipeline Consortium’s terminal in southern Russia early Monday, though Ukraine said it struck a different terminal in Novorossiysk.</li><li>Market sensitivity: The Caspian Pipeline Consortium route is a major outlet for Kazakh crude through the Black Sea, so even localized terminal damage can disrupt tanker schedules and raise oil-trade risk assessments.</li><li>Australian case: Australian police charged a 25-year-old army reservist from Adelaide with allegedly serving as a drone operator for Ukraine without authorization, in the first reported use of that offence.</li></ul><blockquote>If Russia is ready to stop strikes on our energy infrastructure, we will respond in kind - Volodymyr Zelenskyy</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Ukraine government: Kyiv presented the proposal as a narrow, reciprocal pause on strikes against energy sites rather than a general ceasefire, signaling that it sees infrastructure protection as a possible first step even without a broader deal. (<a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/06/zelensky-says-ukraine-proposed-energy-truce-to-russia-through-u-s-intermediaries'>Meduza</a>)</li><li>Volodymyr Zelenskyy: Zelensky framed the Easter appeal as a test of whether Russia is willing to show any restraint, saying Moscow had given no sign that the Orthodox holiday would change its conduct. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/07/ukraine-russia-war-briefing-zelenskyy-orthodox-easter-truce-offer'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Russia’s Defence Ministry: Moscow said Ukrainian drones damaged a mooring point and set oil tanks ablaze at a CPC shipping terminal, while Ukraine said it struck a different terminal in Novorossiysk, highlighting the competing narratives around energy-linked attacks. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/07/ukraine-russia-war-briefing-zelenskyy-orthodox-easter-truce-offer'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/russia-central-asia/article/3349194/3-dead-15-injured-russia-hits-ukraines-port-city-odesa-major-drone-strike'>Ukraine proposes ceasefire on striking energy targets to Russia</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/ukraines-zelenskiy-says-he-stands-by-ceasefire-proposal-to-russia'>Ukraine&#x27;s Zelenskiy says he stands by ceasefire proposal to Russia</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/07/ukraine-russia-war-briefing-zelenskyy-orthodox-easter-truce-offer'>Ukraine war briefing: Zelenskyy reiterates truce offer ahead of Orthodox Easter</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/ukraine-president-volodymyr-zelensky-says-he-stands-by-ceasefire-proposal-to-russia-11320555#publisher=newsstand'>Ukraine&#x27;s Zelensky Says He Stands By Ceasefire Proposal To Russia</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/06/zelensky-says-ukraine-proposed-energy-truce-to-russia-through-u-s-intermediaries'>Zelensky says Ukraine proposed energy truce to Russia through U.S. intermediaries</a> - meduza.io</li></ul>